(3387859, 472474, 53316, '<td valign="top">So I''m living in Canada for several months, and they have Buckley''s (spelling?) - motto: it tastes awful, and it works.  So yeah... this is a good concept!  I like the contrast although I think that it looks like some of the hair blends way too much in the background.  Green and red colors are nice together.</td>', 'So I''m living in Canada for several months, and they have Buckley''s (spelling?) - motto: it tastes awful, and it works.  So yeah... this is a good concept!  I like the contrast although I think that it looks like some of the hair blends way too much in the background.  Green and red colors are nice together.', '2007-02-21 01:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
