(3387871, 472713, 53316, '<td valign="top">Ooh, neat concept! The composition looks a little busy... I like that it is very closeup - really emphasizes what is happening here - but maybe having a solid-colored plate would have minimized the complexity.</td>', 'Ooh, neat concept! The composition looks a little busy... I like that it is very closeup - really emphasizes what is happening here - but maybe having a solid-colored plate would have minimized the complexity.', '2007-02-21 01:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
