(3389524, 469312, 44304, '<td valign="top">The focus is on, but the exposure has suffered in this one.  Blown out highlights will drop your score, especially if they''re in a crucial area such as the face of your subject.  I know it''s nitpicking, but if you''re gonna put forth the effort to enter a challenge you should spell check your title.  Shotting is not shooting.  The kid is cute, and this shot had potential.  Keep shooting.</td>', 'The focus is on, but the exposure has suffered in this one.  Blown out highlights will drop your score, especially if they''re in a crucial area such as the face of your subject.  I know it''s nitpicking, but if you''re gonna put forth the effort to enter a challenge you should spell check your title.  Shotting is not shooting.  The kid is cute, and this shot had potential.  Keep shooting.', '2007-02-21 12:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
