(3389555, 469096, 44304, '<td valign="top">This would have been a good entry in the "low key" challenge.  On some monitors (not mine) people will leave you comments that it''s too dark.  However, I see where you are going with this and like the photo.  Time is the old bald killer.  However, as far as meeting the challenge, I think the image is title dependent and not that great of a fit.  If your score suffers in the challenge, it''s not because of the quality of the photo but because of personal opinions of exposure and challenge requirements.</td>', 'This would have been a good entry in the "low key" challenge.  On some monitors (not mine) people will leave you comments that it''s too dark.  However, I see where you are going with this and like the photo.  Time is the old bald killer.  However, as far as meeting the challenge, I think the image is title dependent and not that great of a fit.  If your score suffers in the challenge, it''s not because of the quality of the photo but because of personal opinions of exposure and challenge requirements.', '2007-02-21 12:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
