(3389581, 472277, 44304, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and love how the title fits it.  I think that the shot was poorly executed and could be improved.  Exposure problems jump out at me.  I assume you know that the highlights and shadows are both blown out, so I''ll assume you were going for a high key shot.  But it''s kind of a half high key, half exposed shot.  Regardless, it''s not a bad image by any means.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I like the idea, and love how the title fits it.  I think that the shot was poorly executed and could be improved.  Exposure problems jump out at me.  I assume you know that the highlights and shadows are both blown out, so I''ll assume you were going for a high key shot.  But it''s kind of a half high key, half exposed shot.  Regardless, it''s not a bad image by any means.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2007-02-21 12:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
