(3389611, 472712, 44304, '<td valign="top">The tilted angle isn''t really doing it for me.  I like the concept of the shot and respect your feelings towards pollution.  The exposure is suffering from sun-haze, adding a reddish tint to the shadows.  The clouds do a great job masking the sun, and I like the effect there.  I think a straightened horizon would get you a point higher score.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'The tilted angle isn''t really doing it for me.  I like the concept of the shot and respect your feelings towards pollution.  The exposure is suffering from sun-haze, adding a reddish tint to the shadows.  The clouds do a great job masking the sun, and I like the effect there.  I think a straightened horizon would get you a point higher score.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2007-02-21 12:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389612, 472419, 72839, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very good along with the ranges of black and white. The touch of green in the spinach is very artistic!</td>', 'The lighting is very good along with the ranges of black and white. The touch of green in the spinach is very artistic!', '2007-02-21 12:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
