(3389624, 471154, 72838, '<td valign="top">Aw, this cute. The Image could be sharper but its good.</td>', 'Aw, this cute. The Image could be sharper but its good.', '2007-02-21 12:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389626, 471542, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice, clear, and sharp. However, the only thing I might suggest changing is adding a few more elements to the picture, such as putting a lamp in the background, or the clock on a nightstand. It seems a bit odd to have everything floating in mid-air! But everythign else is wonderful. :)</td>', 'Nice, clear, and sharp. However, the only thing I might suggest changing is adding a few more elements to the picture, such as putting a lamp in the background, or the clock on a nightstand. It seems a bit odd to have everything floating in mid-air! But everythign else is wonderful. :)', '2007-02-21 12:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
