(3389629, 471641, 44304, '<td valign="top">Really like this one.  The image is not title dependent and you can get a sense of hate just from looking at the bear''s expression.  The only thing I could see that would help the shot is a contrast and saturation boost, and getting rid of the noise in the low-light areas of the photo.  I assume this was probably shot with a point and shoot camera that''s gonna produce noise like that, or at a very high iso since it''s daylight outside.  You should be on track for a good finish in this challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'Really like this one.  The image is not title dependent and you can get a sense of hate just from looking at the bear''s expression.  The only thing I could see that would help the shot is a contrast and saturation boost, and getting rid of the noise in the low-light areas of the photo.  I assume this was probably shot with a point and shoot camera that''s gonna produce noise like that, or at a very high iso since it''s daylight outside.  You should be on track for a good finish in this challenge.  Good luck!', '2007-02-21 12:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
