(3389638, 471183, 63269, '<td valign="top">Either the lighting is a bit off, or it''s been smoothed in Photoshop too much... but what an excellent idea! Fits the challenge nicely - good job!</td>', 'Either the lighting is a bit off, or it''s been smoothed in Photoshop too much... but what an excellent idea! Fits the challenge nicely - good job!', '2007-02-21 12:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
