(3389792, 472586, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, to start off, this image feels a little dark... it''s as if there isn''t anything white in the picture, making everything feel a little murky. Usually that can be fixed by changing the white balence, if your camera has a setting for that. But the focus and lighting is great here, and the shallow DOF is absolutely SUPERB! Excellent idea too! :)</td>', 'Well, to start off, this image feels a little dark... it''s as if there isn''t anything white in the picture, making everything feel a little murky. Usually that can be fixed by changing the white balence, if your camera has a setting for that. But the focus and lighting is great here, and the shallow DOF is absolutely SUPERB! Excellent idea too! :)', '2007-02-21 12:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3389793, 472714, 44304, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot that obviously took some skill to pull off.  Exposure and focus are spot on, and the idea is good as well.  This should finish well in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot that obviously took some skill to pull off.  Exposure and focus are spot on, and the idea is good as well.  This should finish well in the challenge.', '2007-02-21 12:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
