(3390980, 471889, 31307, '<td valign="top">I like the image a lot, but here are my suggestions:<br/> <br/>Step back from the wall a little so that it gets blurred into a plain, pure white background.  The I think the flat lighting is interesting, but I''d be curious to see it with dynamic side lighting--particularly if the sword were to be a physical divider between the lit and shaded sides of the mask.  Because of this, it is important to keep the sword exactly vertical.  Vertical lines imply potential energy which is what this piece is about.  Potential, implied violence.</td>', 'I like the image a lot, but here are my suggestions: Step back from the wall a little so that it gets blurred into a plain, pure white background.  The I think the flat lighting is interesting, but I''d be curious to see it with dynamic side lighting--particularly if the sword were to be a physical divider between the lit and shaded sides of the mask.  Because of this, it is important to keep the sword exactly vertical.  Vertical lines imply potential energy which is what this piece is about.  Potential, implied violence.', '2007-02-21 17:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
