(3394394, 471029, 52765, '<td valign="top">sick</td>', 'sick', '2007-02-22 15:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3394398, 471777, 62187, '<td valign="top">Super...! You''re wish is my command. Score 1...oh wait...I forgot, I think giving a score lower then 4 is rude...so, I don''t like being rude so 4...sorry. I really like the idea behind your photo. Good luck in your endeavors.</td>', 'Super...! You''re wish is my command. Score 1...oh wait...I forgot, I think giving a score lower then 4 is rude...so, I don''t like being rude so 4...sorry. I really like the idea behind your photo. Good luck in your endeavors.', '2007-02-22 15:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
