(3395248, 471271, 18799, '<td valign="top">There you go, teach the kid to deface government property (j/k).  It''s a good take on the challenge.  I would have prefered that the photo was taken somewhere where there wasn''t such a distracting background.  6</td>', 'There you go, teach the kid to deface government property (j/k).  It''s a good take on the challenge.  I would have prefered that the photo was taken somewhere where there wasn''t such a distracting background.  6', '2007-02-22 19:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395251, 472539, 18799, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  If I didn''t know the challenge was "hate", It would have been about the last emotion I would have associated with this picture.  6 on the merits of the nice image alone.</td>', 'Very nice image.  If I didn''t know the challenge was "hate", It would have been about the last emotion I would have associated with this picture.  6 on the merits of the nice image alone.', '2007-02-22 20:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
