(3395259, 472432, 18799, '<td valign="top">Sinister!   I love the expression.  I bothers me that there is an unbalance in the eyes where the right is more open than the left.  If they were both like the left this would have been great.  7</td>', 'Sinister!   I love the expression.  I bothers me that there is an unbalance in the eyes where the right is more open than the left.  If they were both like the left this would have been great.  7', '2007-02-22 20:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
