(3395265, 471638, 18799, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the connection to hate.  I don''t understand the wetness, what it is, or where is came from.  From a technical POV, the crop is a bit awkward the way the head is cut and the skin on the right is blown out.  5</td>', 'I don''t get the connection to hate.  I don''t understand the wetness, what it is, or where is came from.  From a technical POV, the crop is a bit awkward the way the head is cut and the skin on the right is blown out.  5', '2007-02-22 20:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395268, 472291, 18799, '<td valign="top">Lets hope this one does better 10</td>', 'Lets hope this one does better 10', '2007-02-22 20:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395272, 472643, 18799, '<td valign="top">hahaha...ouch!   Nice job!</td>', 'hahaha...ouch!   Nice job!', '2007-02-22 20:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395278, 472583, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the color throws this one off for me. The eyes don''t really scream hate; perhaps something in the background to see what he was focusing his hate would have helped convey the emotion.</td>', 'Good idea, but the color throws this one off for me. The eyes don''t really scream hate; perhaps something in the background to see what he was focusing his hate would have helped convey the emotion.', '2007-02-22 20:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395279, 472020, 70270, '<td valign="top">This is an OK use of infared, but I don''t really get the feeling of cold from this, much less the feeling that you hate the cold.</td>', 'This is an OK use of infared, but I don''t really get the feeling of cold from this, much less the feeling that you hate the cold.', '2007-02-22 20:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395280, 472457, 17203, '<td valign="top">I totally agree, however the beets themselves do not depict hatred at all. Had you shown a face with a tongue sticking out, THEN you''d be onto something!</td>', 'I totally agree, however the beets themselves do not depict hatred at all. Had you shown a face with a tongue sticking out, THEN you''d be onto something!', '2007-02-22 20:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395281, 468844, 17203, '<td valign="top">Cute photo, although I''m not really feeling the hate here. She barely even looks annoyed.</td>', 'Cute photo, although I''m not really feeling the hate here. She barely even looks annoyed.', '2007-02-22 20:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395282, 471693, 70270, '<td valign="top">OK, I get the idea, but what are those towers blocking your view of?  The only thing in the picture is the sky, and you seem to have a decent view of that.  Might have been better to shoot across the towers, so we see the blocked view in the background.  Its a nice picture though, and good job on the black and white conversion.</td>', 'OK, I get the idea, but what are those towers blocking your view of?  The only thing in the picture is the sky, and you seem to have a decent view of that.  Might have been better to shoot across the towers, so we see the blocked view in the background.  Its a nice picture though, and good job on the black and white conversion.', '2007-02-22 20:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395289, 472006, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good use of multiple exposures and nice composition.  Only thing I would suggest is that for the shot on the left to have kept the eyes open, since it would have conveyed insomnia better (looks like he''s sleeping over there).</td>', 'Good use of multiple exposures and nice composition.  Only thing I would suggest is that for the shot on the left to have kept the eyes open, since it would have conveyed insomnia better (looks like he''s sleeping over there).', '2007-02-22 20:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395293, 470512, 70270, '<td valign="top">I hate cigarettes, too, but this image doesn''t really say that to me.  Sorry.</td>', 'I hate cigarettes, too, but this image doesn''t really say that to me.  Sorry.', '2007-02-22 20:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395300, 471185, 70270, '<td valign="top">Not doing it for me.  The liquid looks like red kool-aid, not blood if that''s what you were going for.</td>', 'Not doing it for me.  The liquid looks like red kool-aid, not blood if that''s what you were going for.', '2007-02-22 20:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395303, 472464, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, although I doubt that someone sending that message would have had such nice penmanship!</td>', 'Nice composition, although I doubt that someone sending that message would have had such nice penmanship!', '2007-02-22 20:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395307, 472644, 70270, '<td valign="top">Would have worked better with the bird in focus and the face soft.  He kind of  looks like he''s about to burst out laughing.</td>', 'Would have worked better with the bird in focus and the face soft.  He kind of  looks like he''s about to burst out laughing.', '2007-02-22 20:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395308, 471851, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and exposure, although I''m not sure "hate" is the emotion that''s coming through here.   Good picture, though.</td>', 'Nice lighting and exposure, although I''m not sure "hate" is the emotion that''s coming through here.   Good picture, though.', '2007-02-22 20:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395317, 471542, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure, but what throws it off for me is that his arm is coming down from above, which makes it look he''s standing next to the alarm clock, rather than sleeping next to it (and hating to hear it go off), in which case the arm would have been on the same plane or slightly below the clock. Maybe a shot with the arm extending out from just under the lens towards the clock would have worked better.</td>', 'Nice exposure, but what throws it off for me is that his arm is coming down from above, which makes it look he''s standing next to the alarm clock, rather than sleeping next to it (and hating to hear it go off), in which case the arm would have been on the same plane or slightly below the clock. Maybe a shot with the arm extending out from just under the lens towards the clock would have worked better.', '2007-02-22 20:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395320, 471543, 70270, '<td valign="top">What, you couldn''t sew things up?</td>', 'What, you couldn''t sew things up?', '2007-02-22 20:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
