(3395483, 471271, 52130, '<td valign="top">I wish the pose could have been better because I LOVE the idea. Maybe if you were directly in front of the sign (so that it filled most of the frame and  hid the background) and then have just his hand coming up, it might have been more simple and improved upon. Nice idea though! I''ll definitely want to try something like this in the future :)</td>', 'I wish the pose could have been better because I LOVE the idea. Maybe if you were directly in front of the sign (so that it filled most of the frame and  hid the background) and then have just his hand coming up, it might have been more simple and improved upon. Nice idea though! I''ll definitely want to try something like this in the future :)', '2007-02-22 21:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
