(3395621, 472530, 70270, '<td valign="top">without the title this image doesn''t say much about hate.  Perhaps something in the background to show what the stone was aiming at behind the glass would have helped convey that message.  Leaving aside the challenge, this is an interesting photo with sharp focus and good exposure, tho it suffers a bit from a central point of interest ... its more like an interesting background to a subject than an interesting image in and of itself.</td>', 'without the title this image doesn''t say much about hate.  Perhaps something in the background to show what the stone was aiming at behind the glass would have helped convey that message.  Leaving aside the challenge, this is an interesting photo with sharp focus and good exposure, tho it suffers a bit from a central point of interest ... its more like an interesting background to a subject than an interesting image in and of itself.', '2007-02-22 22:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
