(3395640, 471633, 70270, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  I don''t get the hate here, but I want to know more about what''s happening.  Looks like this could have been a good opportunity for some street photography shots, too.  Leaving aside the challenge topic, its a well composed, well exposed image.  I would like to see a few more faces and expressions tho; lots of backs and tops of heads.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  I don''t get the hate here, but I want to know more about what''s happening.  Looks like this could have been a good opportunity for some street photography shots, too.  Leaving aside the challenge topic, its a well composed, well exposed image.  I would like to see a few more faces and expressions tho; lots of backs and tops of heads.', '2007-02-22 22:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395644, 472125, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good, but not unique, idea.  This image is too flat and has a green cast to it.  Bumping the contrast and saturation and playing with hues might improve it.</td>', 'Good, but not unique, idea.  This image is too flat and has a green cast to it.  Bumping the contrast and saturation and playing with hues might improve it.', '2007-02-22 22:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395647, 472432, 70270, '<td valign="top">Effective composition.</td>', 'Effective composition.', '2007-02-22 22:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395656, 472493, 70270, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really evoke an image of hate.  Composition is off, there are three sets of birds to watch ... one at the left, one in the air, and two off to the right.  The most interesting is the one in the air, and he''s out of focus.  Going in tighter with a longer lens or tighter crop would have helped.</td>', 'Doesn''t really evoke an image of hate.  Composition is off, there are three sets of birds to watch ... one at the left, one in the air, and two off to the right.  The most interesting is the one in the air, and he''s out of focus.  Going in tighter with a longer lens or tighter crop would have helped.', '2007-02-22 23:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395662, 472074, 70270, '<td valign="top">This is a tough one.  I like this image. The lighting is very nice, the composition is well done, and its interesting to look at, if a little grainy (noisy).  But its a pretty big shoehorn to enter in this challenge, imho.</td>', 'This is a tough one.  I like this image. The lighting is very nice, the composition is well done, and its interesting to look at, if a little grainy (noisy).  But its a pretty big shoehorn to enter in this challenge, imho.', '2007-02-22 23:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395665, 472354, 70270, '<td valign="top">Shoehorned in, I''m afraid.  Out of focus and a bit flat too.  Sorry.</td>', 'Shoehorned in, I''m afraid.  Out of focus and a bit flat too.  Sorry.', '2007-02-22 23:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395670, 471889, 70270, '<td valign="top">This one had some potential, but you lost me in two areas: 1) i think cutting off the top of the sword was a mistake, and 2) the lighting is a little harsh, making the image a little flat.  Some side lights to capture the texture of the mask would have improved this a lot.</td>', 'This one had some potential, but you lost me in two areas: 1) i think cutting off the top of the sword was a mistake, and 2) the lighting is a little harsh, making the image a little flat.  Some side lights to capture the texture of the mask would have improved this a lot.', '2007-02-22 23:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395677, 471641, 70270, '<td valign="top">Its all in the eyes.  He looks like he hates you.  A tighter crop on the head is all I would suggest.  Good capture.</td>', 'Its all in the eyes.  He looks like he hates you.  A tighter crop on the head is all I would suggest.  Good capture.', '2007-02-22 23:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395681, 472653, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice image, lighting and composition.</td>', 'Nice image, lighting and composition.', '2007-02-22 23:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395683, 471924, 14620, '<td valign="top">This makes me want to cry.  The tones and composition are very good and the subject matter is compelling, at least to me. Bumping up. :)</td>', 'This makes me want to cry.  The tones and composition are very good and the subject matter is compelling, at least to me. Bumping up. :)', '2007-02-22 23:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395686, 471725, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good subject for B&amp;W, but it came out a little flat in the desaturation; doesn''t really pop like a strong BW image will.</td>', 'Good subject for B&W, but it came out a little flat in the desaturation; doesn''t really pop like a strong BW image will.', '2007-02-22 23:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395727, 471924, 48227, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I really hope this will win. 10</td>', 'Excellent! I really hope this will win. 10', '2007-02-22 23:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395745, 472457, 70270, '<td valign="top">I like beets!</td>', 'I like beets!', '2007-02-22 23:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395749, 470065, 70270, '<td valign="top">got hate?  not seeing the challenge topic here, and as a picture itself its not all that interesting.  Sorry.</td>', 'got hate?  not seeing the challenge topic here, and as a picture itself its not all that interesting.  Sorry.', '2007-02-22 23:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395754, 470421, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good eye.</td>', 'Good eye.', '2007-02-22 23:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395793, 472291, 70270, '<td valign="top">Could have just titled this "Brown"</td>', 'Could have just titled this "Brown"', '2007-02-22 23:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395800, 472283, 70270, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I keep jumping back and forth between the door knob and the knife.  I''d like it better if the light was more on the knife than the knob.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I keep jumping back and forth between the door knob and the knife.  I''d like it better if the light was more on the knife than the knob.', '2007-02-22 23:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395820, 469473, 41574, '<td valign="top">An image I might have been fond of, had it been in focus and creatively composed. Sorry, but this is an interesting concept marred by sloppy execution.</td>', 'An image I might have been fond of, had it been in focus and creatively composed. Sorry, but this is an interesting concept marred by sloppy execution.', '2007-02-22 23:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395823, 472444, 41574, '<td valign="top">What: An orange light? Sorry: it doesn''t make sense to me.</td>', 'What: An orange light? Sorry: it doesn''t make sense to me.', '2007-02-22 23:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395826, 472464, 41574, '<td valign="top">Nice, though the black stripe at the bottom is distracting.</td>', 'Nice, though the black stripe at the bottom is distracting.', '2007-02-22 23:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395827, 472586, 41574, '<td valign="top">I wish the kid''s face were in slightly greater focus, but this is still a really cool shot. Well done.</td>', 'I wish the kid''s face were in slightly greater focus, but this is still a really cool shot. Well done.', '2007-02-22 23:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395830, 471777, 41574, '<td valign="top">What... is this? I don''t even want to bother <i>looking</i> for "him"  sorry.</td>', 'What... is this? I don''t even want to bother looking for "him"  sorry.', '2007-02-22 23:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395835, 472719, 41574, '<td valign="top">I wish the edges were a bit softer, and that the perspective were much steeper or much flatter. Nonetheless, it''s a good shot.</td>', 'I wish the edges were a bit softer, and that the perspective were much steeper or much flatter. Nonetheless, it''s a good shot.', '2007-02-22 23:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395838, 470906, 41574, '<td valign="top">Isn''t the beach free?</td>', 'Isn''t the beach free?', '2007-02-22 23:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395839, 472058, 41574, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2007-02-22 23:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395840, 471399, 14620, '<td valign="top">Way too much processing for my taste.  Kind of steps out of the realm of photography.</td>', 'Way too much processing for my taste.  Kind of steps out of the realm of photography.', '2007-02-22 23:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395841, 472023, 41574, '<td valign="top">Awesome; my first "10" so far.</td>', 'Awesome; my first "10" so far.', '2007-02-22 23:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395844, 470832, 14620, '<td valign="top">The processing on this one hurts it for me.  I know you were probably trying to emphasize the hatred/rage concept with the red face, but it''s just a little too overkill.</td>', 'The processing on this one hurts it for me.  I know you were probably trying to emphasize the hatred/rage concept with the red face, but it''s just a little too overkill.', '2007-02-22 23:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395849, 471777, 14620, '<td valign="top">It took me awhile to figure out what was going on in this photo.  The crosshatching (?) in the background is distracting and made it very hard to see that it was a letter being burned.</td>', 'It took me awhile to figure out what was going on in this photo.  The crosshatching (?) in the background is distracting and made it very hard to see that it was a letter being burned.', '2007-02-22 23:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395850, 470313, 41574, '<td valign="top">I don''t know just how well this can meet the challenge, but, in all honesty, I don''t even really give a damn. This is one of the best shots I''ve seen in a long while -- thanks for posting it.</td>', 'I don''t know just how well this can meet the challenge, but, in all honesty, I don''t even really give a damn. This is one of the best shots I''ve seen in a long while -- thanks for posting it.', '2007-02-22 23:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395851, 472489, 50224, '<td valign="top">Just so you know . . . that doesn''t actually say Evil . . . it is arabic for . . . "Glory be to God"</td>', 'Just so you know . . . that doesn''t actually say Evil . . . it is arabic for . . . "Glory be to God"', '2007-02-22 23:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3395996, 471362, 72252, '<td valign="top">Powerful... great detail and expression of subject matter.</td>', 'Powerful... great detail and expression of subject matter.', '2007-02-23 00:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3396022, 472487, 72252, '<td valign="top">That''s where it starts... great concept and shot.</td>', 'That''s where it starts... great concept and shot.', '2007-02-23 00:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3396024, 470421, 17990, '<td valign="top">Ok... THAT is scary!</td>', 'Ok... THAT is scary!', '2007-02-23 00:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3396036, 470720, 72252, '<td valign="top">Love the action, color and capture.  Lot''s of history in that hate.</td>', 'Love the action, color and capture.  Lot''s of history in that hate.', '2007-02-23 00:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3396043, 470417, 72252, '<td valign="top">Don''t we all?  Really nice shot!</td>', 'Don''t we all?  Really nice shot!', '2007-02-23 00:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3396052, 472356, 72252, '<td valign="top">Been there, done that!</td>', 'Been there, done that!', '2007-02-23 00:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3396058, 469711, 72252, '<td valign="top">Self loathing... the worst.  Really nice shot!</td>', 'Self loathing... the worst.  Really nice shot!', '2007-02-23 00:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3396073, 472023, 72252, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2007-02-23 00:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3396086, 472074, 72252, '<td valign="top">Great capture and I especially like the light tone at the top of the bluff.</td>', 'Great capture and I especially like the light tone at the top of the bluff.', '2007-02-23 00:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3396090, 472002, 72252, '<td valign="top">How you get her to do that?</td>', 'How you get her to do that?', '2007-02-23 00:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3396095, 472433, 72252, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot.</td>', 'Really nice shot.', '2007-02-23 00:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3396105, 471362, 30822, '<td valign="top">Very edgy. Gave it a 10 and am adding to my favorites! Good Luck!</td>', 'Very edgy. Gave it a 10 and am adding to my favorites! Good Luck!', '2007-02-23 00:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3396997, 471869, 74642, '<td valign="top">just beautiful, no comment :)</td>', 'just beautiful, no comment :)', '2007-02-23 08:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397233, 470720, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good subject for the challenge, and lots of action in the photo.  I would have liked to have seen a tighter shot with fewer combatants, which might have provided a stronger point of focus for the image.</td>', 'Good subject for the challenge, and lots of action in the photo.  I would have liked to have seen a tighter shot with fewer combatants, which might have provided a stronger point of focus for the image.', '2007-02-23 09:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397246, 472239, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good moment, just doesn''t say hate to me.  It also could have been improved with a tighter crop starting just to the left of and just below the zebra facing the camera.  The half in/half out zebra distracts from the center of focus in the image.</td>', 'Good moment, just doesn''t say hate to me.  It also could have been improved with a tighter crop starting just to the left of and just below the zebra facing the camera.  The half in/half out zebra distracts from the center of focus in the image.', '2007-02-23 09:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397253, 472132, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lighting, the lines of the tools (instruments of hate?  really?) add visual impact to this image.</td>', 'Nice composition and lighting, the lines of the tools (instruments of hate?  really?) add visual impact to this image.', '2007-02-23 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397264, 472487, 70270, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I would rather have seen it sharp throughout, as I don''t think shallow DOF works in a far away shot like this.  If you had been tighter ni on the two pieces in the foreground, that technique would have worked better, but here you''re asking the viewer to look at all the pieces, not just the foreground ones, so a smaller f-stop would work better.</td>', 'Good idea.  I would rather have seen it sharp throughout, as I don''t think shallow DOF works in a far away shot like this.  If you had been tighter ni on the two pieces in the foreground, that technique would have worked better, but here you''re asking the viewer to look at all the pieces, not just the foreground ones, so a smaller f-stop would work better.', '2007-02-23 09:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397436, 472445, 62727, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  Great idea, love the facial expressions! 10</td>', 'This is awesome!  Great idea, love the facial expressions! 10', '2007-02-23 10:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397444, 472678, 51900, '<td valign="top">like it. 10</td>', 'like it. 10', '2007-02-23 10:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397488, 471731, 72833, '<td valign="top">i like the way this looks far away, nice effect. the lighting is decent, but it''s a little too dark.</td>', 'i like the way this looks far away, nice effect. the lighting is decent, but it''s a little too dark.', '2007-02-23 10:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397496, 469711, 72833, '<td valign="top">nice title, i see where you were going with this photograph. i like the composition, nice contrast. good job.</td>', 'nice title, i see where you were going with this photograph. i like the composition, nice contrast. good job.', '2007-02-23 10:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397501, 472564, 72833, '<td valign="top">very smart angle. i like the way you put the light only on your subject, very emphasizing. nice work.</td>', 'very smart angle. i like the way you put the light only on your subject, very emphasizing. nice work.', '2007-02-23 11:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397503, 471727, 72833, '<td valign="top">its a nice effect how the light is hitting the cactus here. also, great angle and composition.</td>', 'its a nice effect how the light is hitting the cactus here. also, great angle and composition.', '2007-02-23 11:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397509, 470512, 72833, '<td valign="top">i hate them too. cool idea, i see where you were going with the lighting, but it could catch the viewers eye more if it was brightened up.</td>', 'i hate them too. cool idea, i see where you were going with the lighting, but it could catch the viewers eye more if it was brightened up.', '2007-02-23 11:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397513, 472023, 72833, '<td valign="top">like the message. great composition, even the shadowing is nice. overall, i really like this. nice job.</td>', 'like the message. great composition, even the shadowing is nice. overall, i really like this. nice job.', '2007-02-23 11:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397515, 472718, 72833, '<td valign="top">i love the clarity in this image. i like the simplicity, just a facial expression, it sends a very impacting message.</td>', 'i love the clarity in this image. i like the simplicity, just a facial expression, it sends a very impacting message.', '2007-02-23 11:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397535, 471362, 72833, '<td valign="top">excellent composition, the contrast works really well with the mood set. great job with using a background subject too.</td>', 'excellent composition, the contrast works really well with the mood set. great job with using a background subject too.', '2007-02-23 11:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397648, 471115, 33515, '<td valign="top">And I can see why! A little bit of fill flash to reduce the shadows may have helped a bit. Overall very nice.</td>', 'And I can see why! A little bit of fill flash to reduce the shadows may have helped a bit. Overall very nice.', '2007-02-23 11:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397663, 471805, 33515, '<td valign="top">Seems to lack overall contrast, a bit more white may have brought out more detail in the darker areas. Looks like she has a good hold!</td>', 'Seems to lack overall contrast, a bit more white may have brought out more detail in the darker areas. Looks like she has a good hold!', '2007-02-23 11:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397668, 472644, 33515, '<td valign="top">Never heard that saying, mind it I use it dome time? IMO the hand really needs to have some detail to bring more meaning to the photo.</td>', 'Never heard that saying, mind it I use it dome time? IMO the hand really needs to have some detail to bring more meaning to the photo.', '2007-02-23 12:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397676, 471341, 33515, '<td valign="top">All that is lacking is a bit of spit coming out of her mouth, nice entry. The only thing I might chance is to have her eyes open really staring him down.</td>', 'All that is lacking is a bit of spit coming out of her mouth, nice entry. The only thing I might chance is to have her eyes open really staring him down.', '2007-02-23 12:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397679, 472474, 72833, '<td valign="top">nice use of color, i really enjoy the composition. the lighting works well here too. good job.</td>', 'nice use of color, i really enjoy the composition. the lighting works well here too. good job.', '2007-02-23 12:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397682, 468844, 33515, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit more sharpness, I don''t feel the hate part.</td>', 'Needs a bit more sharpness, I don''t feel the hate part.', '2007-02-23 12:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397690, 470417, 72833, '<td valign="top">this is cool, perfect timing. i like how it ties in with ''hate''. good contrast, too.</td>', 'this is cool, perfect timing. i like how it ties in with ''hate''. good contrast, too.', '2007-02-23 12:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397833, 472074, 34041, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve heard this already from others, but IMO there is too much boring foreground, and overall the composition is a bit lacking.  However, the lighting in great. 6 from me for the lighting alone.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve heard this already from others, but IMO there is too much boring foreground, and overall the composition is a bit lacking.  However, the lighting in great. 6 from me for the lighting alone.', '2007-02-23 12:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397839, 472058, 34041, '<td valign="top">Love the blue tones. And the tears.  Very emotive. 8 from me.</td>', 'Love the blue tones. And the tears.  Very emotive. 8 from me.', '2007-02-23 12:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397857, 470832, 34041, '<td valign="top">Odd colors.  blown highlites on her cheeks.</td>', 'Odd colors.  blown highlites on her cheeks.', '2007-02-23 12:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397861, 471805, 34041, '<td valign="top">could stand to have a bump in contrast</td>', 'could stand to have a bump in contrast', '2007-02-23 12:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397874, 472583, 34041, '<td valign="top">Didn''t they have white hoods, not pink?</td>', 'Didn''t they have white hoods, not pink?', '2007-02-23 12:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397878, 472470, 34041, '<td valign="top">great concept. Too bad the light didn''t hit th main area of the wall.</td>', 'great concept. Too bad the light didn''t hit th main area of the wall.', '2007-02-23 12:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397881, 472342, 34041, '<td valign="top">Wow.  very emotive.  Nice "foggy" look, too.  How did you do that?  9 from me.</td>', 'Wow.  very emotive.  Nice "foggy" look, too.  How did you do that?  9 from me.', '2007-02-23 12:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397886, 472419, 34041, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on de-sat.  I had to look at it twice to realize the colors were still there, but so muted.  nice - 7 from me.</td>', 'Interesting take on de-sat.  I had to look at it twice to realize the colors were still there, but so muted.  nice - 7 from me.', '2007-02-23 12:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397893, 470421, 34041, '<td valign="top">Ah ha - the devil - I had to look for a few seconds to see it, and your title got me to take that extra time.  Nice job 7 from me.</td>', 'Ah ha - the devil - I had to look for a few seconds to see it, and your title got me to take that extra time.  Nice job 7 from me.', '2007-02-23 12:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397934, 472043, 34041, '<td valign="top">This looks oversharpend (showing obvious haloing) and the whites look blown.  Composition is good, and so is the cropping.</td>', 'This looks oversharpend (showing obvious haloing) and the whites look blown.  Composition is good, and so is the cropping.', '2007-02-23 13:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397942, 472354, 62077, '<td valign="top">use spray against them! :) I''ve wished to see a closer detail of it( you can try on the next shots to capture it and keep it for a short time on the fridge( I am not joking) and after,you can play with the macro.In one minute-two, it will be alive again( but I think not for long :).</td>', 'use spray against them! :) I''ve wished to see a closer detail of it( you can try on the next shots to capture it and keep it for a short time on the fridge( I am not joking) and after,you can play with the macro.In one minute-two, it will be alive again( but I think not for long :).', '2007-02-23 13:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398005, 471115, 11920, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2007-02-23 13:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398007, 472074, 69102, '<td valign="top">either more sky, or more dune would have made the idea of loneliness come across better. but you would still be stretching for "hate." - 4</td>', 'either more sky, or more dune would have made the idea of loneliness come across better. but you would still be stretching for "hate." - 4', '2007-02-23 13:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398011, 472664, 69102, '<td valign="top">cool. love to find out how you managed this in basic editing. - 6</td>', 'cool. love to find out how you managed this in basic editing. - 6', '2007-02-23 13:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398013, 471725, 11920, '<td valign="top">He looks a bit like Anthony Bourdain. Love the idea.</td>', 'He looks a bit like Anthony Bourdain. Love the idea.', '2007-02-23 13:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3398015, 472020, 69102, '<td valign="top">actually the tones of this photograph are quite inviting, so even with the title this really doesn''t convey "hate" for me. - 4.</td>', 'actually the tones of this photograph are quite inviting, so even with the title this really doesn''t convey "hate" for me. - 4.', '2007-02-23 13:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
