(3411803, 471641, 74534, '<td valign="top">Oh, come on, how is this only a 5.2? I personally like it a lot. It just flows of "hate". I don''t know how natural the red eyes are, or if it''s photoshop, but it works so well. I gave it a 9 (apparently the only one :)<br/> <br/>I feel this image conveys the hate message a lot more than "I hate cleaning the toilet" and so on... Maybe a more subtle title would have worked. And probably more context too, though it would have distracted attention from the red eyes.</td>', 'Oh, come on, how is this only a 5.2? I personally like it a lot. It just flows of "hate". I don''t know how natural the red eyes are, or if it''s photoshop, but it works so well. I gave it a 9 (apparently the only one :) I feel this image conveys the hate message a lot more than "I hate cleaning the toilet" and so on... Maybe a more subtle title would have worked. And probably more context too, though it would have distracted attention from the red eyes.', '2007-02-28 00:49:55.000000', NULL, 0),
