(3420893, 471341, 14620, '<td valign="top">I didn''t even realize this was you two. :)  Excellent lighting and toning.  I like it because while it''s a set-up shot (at least I hope it is for the sake of Elvis'' ears) ;-P, it looks genuine.  I find that''s the hardest thing to pull off, the look of real emotion without it coming out cheesy or obviously set-up.  Well Done!!</td>', 'I didn''t even realize this was you two. :)  Excellent lighting and toning.  I like it because while it''s a set-up shot (at least I hope it is for the sake of Elvis'' ears) ;-P, it looks genuine.  I find that''s the hardest thing to pull off, the look of real emotion without it coming out cheesy or obviously set-up.  Well Done!!', '2007-03-01 21:41:21.000000', NULL, 0),
